 <name>deepclone</name>
 <channel>pecl.php.net</channel>
 <summary>Deep-clone any serializable PHP value as a pure array payload</summary>
 <description>This extension deep-clones any serializable PHP value, faster and with less memory than unserialize(serialize()): strings and arrays keep their copy-on-write semantics. It turns the value into a payload made of scalars and nested arrays only, and back. That is the format of Symfony's DeepCloner, which uses the extension when it is loaded and its polyfill otherwise.</description>
